# Pins the bd version that the generated CLI docs are produced from and
# validated against: docs/CLI_REFERENCE.md, docs/cli-reference/, and the
# CLI Reference pages array in docs/docs.json.
#
# This fork's docs describe its default branch, not the last upstream
# release, so the pin is HEAD: the docs pipeline builds bd from the current
# checkout. Regenerate with ./scripts/generate-cli-docs.sh in the same change
# as any command-surface edit. docs/reference/fork-status.md lists what the
# default branch adds over the last upstream release.
#
# A release tag here (e.g. v1.3.4) builds bd from that tag instead.
HEAD
